{"page":496,"blocks":[{"x":0.04849,"y":0.05257,"w":0.29299,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"482 Chapter 8: Techniques of Integration"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.09345,"w":0.58888,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"The polynomials on both sides of the above equation are identical, so we equate coeffi- cients of like powers of x, obtaining"},{"x":0.47679,"y":0.13167,"w":0.27384,"h":0.05002,"fs":0.01279,"n":8,"k":0,"t":"Coefficient of x2: A + B + C = 1 Coefficient of x1: 4A + 2B = 4 Coefficient of x0: 3A - 3B - C = 1"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.19319,"w":0.59297,"h":0.0435,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"There are several ways of solving such a system of linear equations for the unknowns A, B, and C, including elimination of variables or the use of a calculator or computer. Whatever method is used, the solution is A = 3>4, B = 1>2, and C = -1>4. Hence we have"},{"x":0.36418,"y":0.24351,"w":0.18847,"h":0.03235,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"x2 + 4x + 1 (x - 1)(x + 1)(x + 3) dx ="},{"x":0.57928,"y":0.24543,"w":0.01522,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"c 3"},{"x":0.73968,"y":0.24543,"w":0.07917,"h":0.03044,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"4 1 x + 3 d dx"},{"x":0.58632,"y":0.24884,"w":0.08487,"h":0.02702,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"4 1 x - 1 + 1"},{"x":0.663,"y":0.24884,"w":0.08487,"h":0.02702,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"2 1 x + 1 - 1"},{"x":0.56008,"y":0.27858,"w":0.32988,"h":0.03309,"fs":0.01353,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"4 ln 0 x - 10 + 1 2 ln 0 x + 10 - 1 4 ln 0 x + 30 + K,"},{"x":0.543,"y":0.28448,"w":0.02525,"h":0.01999,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"= 3"},{"x":0.32333,"y":0.31468,"w":0.59307,"h":0.02815,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"where K is the arbitrary constant of integration (to avoid confusion with the undetermined coefficient we labeled as C)."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.35903,"w":0.32898,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 2 Use partial fractions to evaluate"},{"x":0.58674,"y":0.38483,"w":0.07984,"h":0.02957,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"6x + 7 (x + 2)2 dx."},{"x":0.32333,"y":0.42639,"w":0.59302,"h":0.02899,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"Solution First we express the integrand as a sum of partial fractions with undetermined coefficients."},{"x":0.44201,"y":0.46668,"w":0.20116,"h":0.02957,"fs":0.01279,"n":6,"k":0,"t":"6x + 7 (x + 2)2 = A x + 2 + B (x + 2)2"},{"x":0.45036,"y":0.50329,"w":0.39705,"h":0.03266,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"6x + 7 = A(x + 2) + B Multiply both sides by (x + 2)2. = Ax + (2A + B)"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.54616,"w":0.3721,"h":0.01281,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Equating coefficients of corresponding powers of x gives"},{"x":0.33772,"y":0.56852,"w":0.56098,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":7,"k":0,"t":"A = 6 and 2A + B = 12 + B = 7, or A = 6 and B = -5."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.59222,"w":0.06858,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Therefore,"},{"x":0.58868,"y":0.61375,"w":0.15753,"h":0.03213,"fs":0.01279,"n":5,"k":0,"t":"a 6 x + 2 - 5 (x + 2)2b dx"},{"x":0.4693,"y":0.61631,"w":0.09276,"h":0.02957,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"6x + 7 (x + 2)2 dx ="},{"x":0.59938,"y":0.65663,"w":0.07237,"h":0.02721,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"dx x + 2 - 5"},{"x":0.68939,"y":0.65935,"w":0.08262,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"(x + 2)-2 dx"},{"x":0.55239,"y":0.66316,"w":0.02518,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"= 6"},{"x":0.5524,"y":0.68144,"w":0.23244,"h":0.02588,"fs":0.01353,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"= 6 ln 0 x + 20 + 5(x + 2)-1 + C."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.71607,"w":0.58894,"h":0.03858,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"The next example shows how to handle the case when ƒ(x)>g(x) is an improper frac- tion. It is a case where the degree of ƒ is larger than the degree of g."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.77084,"w":0.32898,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 3 Use partial fractions to evaluate"},{"x":0.54925,"y":0.79216,"w":0.15481,"h":0.03404,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"2x3 - 4x2 - x - 3 x2 - 2x - 3 dx."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.83435,"w":0.59307,"h":0.02899,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"Solution First we divide the denominator into the numerator to get a polynomial plus a proper fraction."},{"x":0.50298,"y":0.86972,"w":0.22963,"h":0.06652,"fs":0.01401,"n":5,"k":0,"t":"2x x2 - 2x - 3)2x3 - 4x2 - x - 3 2x3 - 4x2 - 6x - 3 5x - 3"}]}